# Group calls in a fight with the player's group (kind combat, /group). The code picks the topic at the
# matching moment: a pull, an add, out of power, low health, a big heal, mez and mez broken, root, stun,
# taunt, a kill, a wipe, the rest after a fight, and a rez. Keep each topic strictly about its moment.
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices/TALKING-UPDATE-CONTENT.md).

# ---- pull: the bot pulls, or sees the pull coming -----------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic pull
@who *
@needs in_player_group
incoming
inc, get ready
pulling, get set
here it comes
pull on the way
one coming, on me
inc 1
heads up, pull inc
ready? pulling now
bringing it in
@who Daredevil
pulling the big one, trust me
@who Leveler

# ---- add: another monster joined ----------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic add
@who *
@needs in_player_group
add, add
got an add
add inc
we have an add
another one, add!
add, someone grab it
two now, careful
add, mez it if you can
extra coming in
@who Daredevil
add, we can take it

# ---- oom: out of power --------------------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic oom
@who *
@needs in_player_group,is_caster
oom
oom, sorry
out of power
oom, meleeing with my staff lol
0 power, need a sec
dry, nothing left
@needs in_player_group,is_healer
oom, no more heals
oom! careful
last heal, then im oom
oom, pot me or pray
healer oom, slow down

# ---- low_hp: the bot is hurt --------------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic low_hp
@who *
@needs in_player_group
low!
heal me
need a heal
hp low, help
im dying here
getting chewed up, heals pls
almost dead
dont let me die
ouch, red hp
help, its eating me
@who Daredevil
low but fine, keep hitting

# ---- heal_big: a group heal ---------------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic heal_big
@who *
@needs in_player_group,is_healer
group heal
group heal inc, stay close
big heal going out
hang on, healing everyone
bunch up, group heal
topping everyone off
heals up, stay in range
healing group, keep hitting
big heal, everyone hold on
all of you, stay close to me

# ---- mez: the bot mezzes an add -----------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic mez
@who *
@needs in_player_group,is_support
mezzed
mez on the add
add mezzed, dont touch it
mezzed, leave it alone
@needs in_player_group,is_caster
mez up, hands off
sleeping the add, ignore it
mezzed the add, kill the first one
mez is in, no aoe
@needs in_player_group,is_support
mezzed, dont pbaoe
mez on, fight the other one

# ---- mez_broke: the mez is off -------------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic mez_broke
@who *
@needs in_player_group,is_support
mez is off
who broke my mez
it woke up
mez broke, remezzing
@needs in_player_group,is_caster
resisted, mez failed
mez down, careful
add is loose
it resisted, watch out
@needs in_player_group,is_support
mez broke, its loose
broke early, sorry

