taunt, come here you
got aggro back
mine now, heal me
eyes on me

# ---- kill: the fight just ended well -------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic kill
@who *
@needs in_player_group
gj
nice
easy
dead
clean
next
that went well
and stay down
nice work all
smooth
