too easy
@who Leveler
nice xp, next

# ---- wipe: the group is dying, run ---------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic wipe
@who *
@needs in_player_group
run!
wipe, run
everyone run
its over, run
leave me, go
not this one, run
too many, get out
bail bail
run to the zone line
@who Daredevil
go, ill hold them

# ---- rest: after the fight, med and rebuff -------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic rest
@who *
@needs in_player_group
med up
sitting
short break, heal up
everyone sit
endurance break
give me a sec to med
@needs in_player_group,is_support
rebuff time
rebuffing, one sec
buffs before the next one

# ---- rez: rezzing someone ------------------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic rez
@who *
@needs in_player_group,can_rez
rezzing
rez inc
rezzing, dont release
hold on, rez coming
wait for the rez
rez up, accept it
rezzing, sit and med after
rez on the way
rezzing, hang tight
rez going up

# The talking update audit: only a power user rests for power
@kind combat
@topic rest
@who *
@realm *
@class Wizard,Theurgist,Sorcerer,Cabalist,Necromancer,Cleric,Friar,Minstrel,Healer,Shaman,Runemaster,Spiritmaster,Bonedancer,Skald,Eldritch,Enchanter,Mentalist,Animist,Druid,Bard,Warden
@levels 1-50
@needs in_player_group
need power, sitting
